1
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,360
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,810
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,620
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:21,960
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,480
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:32,220
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:36,090
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:39,560
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:42,810
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,560
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:49,100
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,980
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:00,360
=Episode 22=

15
00:01:16,079 --> 00:01:17,120
What's going on?

16
00:01:17,439 --> 00:01:18,079
Impossible.

17
00:01:18,879 --> 00:01:21,280
The young sect master is already
in the Minor Perfection Realm.

18
00:01:21,879 --> 00:01:23,879
Is she going easy on him?

19
00:01:24,439 --> 00:01:25,239
(How is this possible?)

20
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:27,120
(I used all my strength.)

21
00:01:27,319 --> 00:01:29,280
(Yet I was blasted back
by his protective qi.)

22
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:30,040
(No... This can't be...)

23
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:31,000
(I don't believe it!)

24
00:01:31,079 --> 00:01:31,640
No way.

25
00:01:32,319 --> 00:01:33,799
Could this guy be the dark horse?

26
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:34,640
We're doomed.

27
00:01:35,079 --> 00:01:36,400
Zhao Feiyang is that strong?

28
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:37,079
Senior Brother Lin.

29
00:01:37,439 --> 00:01:39,439
Can you still get your revenge?

30
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:40,840
I... I...

31
00:01:41,799 --> 00:01:43,040
Let's find a chance to run.

32
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:44,319
It's fine.

33
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:45,400
Let's keep watching.

34
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,640
Maybe Cuihua did it on purpose.

35
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:50,280
Cuihua, what are you doing?

36
00:01:50,439 --> 00:01:52,200
Pick up your sword and stop him.

37
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,200
Don't hold back.

38
00:01:55,799 --> 00:01:56,480
Zhao Feiyang!

39
00:02:00,439 --> 00:02:01,400
You are no match for me.

40
00:02:02,319 --> 00:02:03,040
Stand down.

41
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,319
I...

42
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:16,560
I lost.

43
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,159
She conceded?

44
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:31,680
In that case,

45
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:34,560
the new spirit vein in
the Southern Domain

46
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,240
belongs to Solitude Sect.

47
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,360
This...

48
00:02:41,319 --> 00:02:42,919
If we can't secure this spirit vein,

49
00:02:43,479 --> 00:02:44,800
what of our future disciples?

50
00:02:45,479 --> 00:02:46,319
At this rate,

51
00:02:46,759 --> 00:02:47,800
within 20 years,

52
00:02:48,479 --> 00:02:49,680
even our combined sects

53
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,719
will struggle to survive.

54
00:02:52,159 --> 00:02:52,879
Don't worry.

55
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,360
The Heavenly Sword Sect

56
00:02:54,639 --> 00:02:56,000
must be even more desperate.

57
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:58,120
If no one objects,

58
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,759
I'll go see my spirit vein.

59
00:03:00,759 --> 00:03:01,319
Wait.

60
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,759
What do you mean, Sect Master?

61
00:03:10,199 --> 00:03:11,360
You said before

62
00:03:11,879 --> 00:03:13,879
everyone may claim the vein.

63
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:14,759
If so,

64
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:17,280
a disciple contest alone means nothing.

65
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:18,120
Zhao Feiyang.

66
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:20,199
Do you dare fight me?

67
00:03:20,319 --> 00:03:22,080
The winner claims the vein.

68
00:03:23,199 --> 00:03:23,759
Excellent.

69
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,400
The Sect Master will fight.

70
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:27,680
Zhao Feiyang won't get the spirit vein.

71
00:03:28,039 --> 00:03:29,039
You're openly stealing it.

72
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,280
Mind your tongue.

73
00:03:30,639 --> 00:03:31,240
Zhao Feiyang.

74
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:33,120
You represent Solitude Sect.

75
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:35,879
Our Sect Master represents
the Heavenly Sword Sect.

76
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:38,520
You'd better hand over
the formation jade slip,

77
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,000
then get lost.

78
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,520
(Wang Feng is the Sect Master
of the Heavenly Sword Sect.)

79
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,759
(He reached Stage 9 of the
Minor Perfection Realm a century ago.)

80
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,719
(After a century of cultivation,)

81
00:03:49,439 --> 00:03:50,879
(he may have reached the
Greater Perfection Realm.)

82
00:03:51,879 --> 00:03:53,400
(He is stronger than me.)

83
00:03:53,879 --> 00:03:55,319
(But I need a chance to break through.)

84
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:58,120
(Wang Feng is the ideal opponent.)

85
00:03:58,759 --> 00:04:00,400
Sect Master,
since you're eager to fight,

86
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,479
how could I refuse?

87
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,280
He...

88
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:09,319
He's insane.

89
00:04:09,719 --> 00:04:11,439
He actually accepted the challenge!

90
00:04:11,639 --> 00:04:12,879
This doesn't seem that simple.

91
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:15,000
What now? Sect Master Wang stepped in.

92
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:17,000
We can't sit and wait.

93
00:04:18,079 --> 00:04:18,519
Attack.

94
00:04:21,639 --> 00:04:22,519
It's come to this.

95
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:25,079
Rules are now meaningless.

96
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:27,480
Today, strength decides all.

97
00:04:28,079 --> 00:04:28,839
Whoever wins

98
00:04:29,879 --> 00:04:31,360
claims the spirit vein.

99
00:04:31,519 --> 00:04:32,720
Spiritual energy is fading.

100
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:34,240
The martial world's rules

101
00:04:34,399 --> 00:04:35,560
and honor mean nothing now.

102
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:36,680
Might rules all.

103
00:04:37,079 --> 00:04:38,879
Sect Master Wang, forgive us.

104
00:04:39,399 --> 00:04:40,480
Enough talk.

105
00:04:40,759 --> 00:04:41,519
Begin.

106
00:04:51,519 --> 00:04:52,879
Heavenburn Sword Shadow.

107
00:05:12,759 --> 00:05:13,319
He fled.

108
00:05:13,399 --> 00:05:14,240
Where is Zhao Feiyang?

109
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,560
Darn.

110
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,199
Lin Xuan.

111
00:05:26,839 --> 00:05:27,519
Thank you, Sect Master.

112
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:30,639
The brat was only bluffing.

113
00:05:30,959 --> 00:05:33,720
He fled with the formation jade slip.

114
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:35,639
What should we do?

115
00:05:35,879 --> 00:05:37,240
Taking it changes nothing.

116
00:05:37,839 --> 00:05:38,680
The spirit vein remains.

117
00:05:39,319 --> 00:05:41,560
The formation jade slip
is merely the key to unlock it.

118
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,560
Even in his hands,

119
00:05:42,879 --> 00:05:44,560
the vein remains unclaimed.

120
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:45,600
At this point,

121
00:05:45,959 --> 00:05:47,079
the jade slip is gone.

122
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,199
Everyone should head back.

123
00:05:50,079 --> 00:05:50,959
What do we do next?

124
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:52,360
Return at once.

125
00:05:52,879 --> 00:05:54,920
Rally our disciples and elders
to seize the spirit vein.

126
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,759
With our two sects united,

127
00:05:56,959 --> 00:05:57,839
we have the advantage.

128
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:06,680
I'm sorry.

129
00:06:06,959 --> 00:06:07,439
Father.

130
00:06:08,439 --> 00:06:09,680
I disappointed you.

131
00:06:10,439 --> 00:06:12,199
We poured all the sect's best

132
00:06:12,279 --> 00:06:13,720
resources into your cultivation.

133
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:16,600
Yet you lost to a worthless man

134
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,399
who had to start over.

135
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:19,360
You truly...

136
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:22,399
I'm sorry.

137
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,879
Please calm down, Sect Master.

138
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:27,759
The spirit vein matters most now.

139
00:06:27,879 --> 00:06:28,399
Yes.

140
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,000
This is critical.

141
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:32,160
If our sect loses this spirit vein too,

142
00:06:32,319 --> 00:06:33,079
then our future...

143
00:06:35,759 --> 00:06:37,800
Gather every disciple in the
Spirit Awakening Realm or higher,

144
00:06:37,879 --> 00:06:38,839
along with the four of us.

145
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,800
We'll all move out
to seize the spirit vein.

146
00:06:41,839 --> 00:06:43,720
All of us move out
to seize the spirit vein?

147
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:46,800
But we're weaker than they are.

148
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:48,240
Then we'll fight to the death.

149
00:06:48,879 --> 00:06:50,399
Our sect's survival is at stake.

150
00:06:50,959 --> 00:06:53,040
If the nest falls, no egg survives.

151
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,680
Yes, Sect Master.

152
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,360
Yes.

153
00:07:18,199 --> 00:07:20,480
The formation suppresses
the spirit vein.

154
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:24,040
We can only absorb
the spiritual energy leaking out.

155
00:07:24,319 --> 00:07:25,759
It's barely anything.

156
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,839
Enough with the nonsense.

157
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,439
The Three Great Sects

158
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:29,720
are deciding who gets it.

159
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:31,120
Once they decide,

160
00:07:31,319 --> 00:07:32,079
we rogue cultivators

161
00:07:32,199 --> 00:07:33,079
won't get a single scrap.

162
00:07:33,399 --> 00:07:34,040
Start cultivating.

163
00:07:41,279 --> 00:07:42,040
I'm not stupid enough

164
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:43,199
to spar with three cultivators
in the Greater Perfection Realm.

165
00:07:43,519 --> 00:07:44,399
What matters now

166
00:07:44,519 --> 00:07:45,600
is to drain this spirit vein

167
00:07:45,759 --> 00:07:46,759
before they get here.

168
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:48,279
With the formation jade slip,

169
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:49,480
I can absorb it faster.

170
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:59,040
So many rogue cultivators want a share.

171
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:00,720
Someone else is coming?

172
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:02,079
Is he from a sect?

173
00:08:02,199 --> 00:08:02,680
Relax.

174
00:08:03,199 --> 00:08:04,160
Look at that sorry sight.

175
00:08:04,519 --> 00:08:05,399
Likely another rogue cultivator.

176
00:08:06,399 --> 00:08:08,000
Boy, there's no room here.

177
00:08:08,199 --> 00:08:09,199
Cultivate somewhere else.

178
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,040
Everyone.

179
00:08:10,639 --> 00:08:11,800
This spirit vein is mine.

180
00:08:12,079 --> 00:08:13,319
Leave at once.

181
00:08:13,759 --> 00:08:14,399
What?

182
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,360
Yours?

183
00:08:15,759 --> 00:08:16,720
Who do you think you are?

184
00:08:16,879 --> 00:08:18,040
I'm in a hurry.

185
00:08:18,759 --> 00:08:20,319
You have three breaths.

186
00:08:24,959 --> 00:08:25,879
Such arrogance!

187
00:08:26,279 --> 00:08:27,319
Brothers, get him.

188
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:48,039
I never meant to kill them.

189
00:08:49,679 --> 00:08:50,639
But this sword...

190
00:08:53,039 --> 00:08:54,480
All the spiritual energy

191
00:08:55,519 --> 00:08:56,440
from the cultivators it just killed

192
00:08:57,559 --> 00:08:59,279
was absorbed into me.

193
00:09:00,399 --> 00:09:01,840
This sword is truly sinister.

194
00:09:04,879 --> 00:09:05,759
No time for this.

195
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:08,559
I'll drain this spirit vein first.

196
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,559
This vein is rich with spiritual energy.

197
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,399
That's about ten million
spirit crystals.

198
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:34,519
I'll absorb it all in seven days.

199
00:09:38,561 --> 00:09:41,234
♪For the rest of my life,
whose face will I seek?♪

200
00:09:41,287 --> 00:09:44,053
♪Rouge-stained tears deepen
the wounds I bear.♪

201
00:09:44,107 --> 00:09:49,475
♪In less than an instant,
how could love fall apart?♪

202
00:09:49,615 --> 00:09:51,901
♪I ask the world,
as blood blooms into flowers♪

203
00:09:51,943 --> 00:09:54,589
♪When petals fall,
whose obsession can't be severed?♪

204
00:09:54,669 --> 00:09:57,296
♪Falling from the cliff♪

205
00:09:57,417 --> 00:09:59,363
♪Still, promise me three lives♪

206
00:09:59,383 --> 00:10:02,536
♪To tie our hair as one♪

207
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:08,080
After draining this spirit vein,

208
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:09,440
the spiritual energy within me

209
00:10:09,759 --> 00:10:11,360
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
has reached a terrifying level.

210
00:10:11,799 --> 00:10:12,840
I need only one opportunity.

211
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:14,759
I may break through a major realm.

212
00:10:22,399 --> 00:10:23,279
Heavenly Sword Sect.

213
00:10:24,919 --> 00:10:26,559
I spent seven years here.

214
00:10:26,799 --> 00:10:27,279
Forgive me.

215
00:10:28,399 --> 00:10:29,679
The moment I left,

216
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,279
the bond between us ended.

217
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,639
Has the sect really fallen this far?

218
00:10:58,799 --> 00:11:00,279
Few resources remain,

219
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:02,840
and even its main spirit vein
is nearly dry.

220
00:11:03,279 --> 00:11:04,200
Better than nothing.

221
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:05,399
I'll absorb it too.

222
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:41,679
You're free now.

223
00:12:02,919 --> 00:12:03,679
What's going on?

224
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:04,840
The spirit vein?

225
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:07,080
Why is all its spiritual energy gone?

226
00:12:07,679 --> 00:12:08,279
Impossible.

227
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:09,879
This new spirit vein

228
00:12:10,159 --> 00:12:11,279
was rich with spiritual energy.

229
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:13,080
I estimated

230
00:12:13,639 --> 00:12:15,399
at least ten million spirit crystals.

231
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:16,600
Why?

232
00:12:17,519 --> 00:12:18,639
Why are there no spirit crystals?

233
00:12:20,806 --> 00:12:24,116
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

234
00:12:24,216 --> 00:12:27,366
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

235
00:12:27,676 --> 00:12:30,116
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

236
00:12:30,336 --> 00:12:33,996
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

237
00:12:41,546 --> 00:12:47,919
♪Write the past as rhyme♪

238
00:12:48,273 --> 00:12:50,233
♪Where snow and wind end♪

239
00:12:50,280 --> 00:12:55,035
♪Spring wakes the land anew♪

240
00:12:55,067 --> 00:12:57,400
♪When I restore the land of old♪

241
00:12:57,467 --> 00:13:01,797
♪I'll challenge Heaven and Earth again♪

242
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:10,679
Three years as chief disciple

243
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:13,039
taught me formations inside out.

244
00:13:13,519 --> 00:13:14,080
Who knew

245
00:13:14,519 --> 00:13:16,399
I'd absorb it all in two days?

246
00:13:18,159 --> 00:13:19,600
I wonder if there's still time

247
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,120
to get to Tianwu Sect and Qingyun Sect.

248
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:26,799
Heavenly Sword Sect.

249
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:28,440
Was this your doing?

250
00:13:29,039 --> 00:13:29,799
Nonsense.

251
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:31,639
When we arrived,

252
00:13:31,799 --> 00:13:32,759
you were already here.

253
00:13:33,279 --> 00:13:34,679
Did you destroy the spirit vein

254
00:13:35,519 --> 00:13:37,039
and try to frame us?

255
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:39,679
It's over.

256
00:13:40,399 --> 00:13:41,000
Back to the sect.

257
00:13:44,159 --> 00:13:44,519
Go.

258
00:13:50,426 --> 00:13:54,056
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

259
00:13:54,213 --> 00:13:56,883
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

260
00:13:57,143 --> 00:14:00,693
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

261
00:14:00,873 --> 00:14:05,073
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

262
00:14:05,523 --> 00:14:08,773
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

263
00:14:09,143 --> 00:14:11,953
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

264
00:14:12,263 --> 00:14:15,643
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

265
00:14:15,773 --> 00:14:20,003
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

266
00:14:20,443 --> 00:14:23,573
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

267
00:14:23,863 --> 00:14:26,943
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

268
00:14:27,513 --> 00:14:30,353
♪With this flesh and soul♪

269
00:14:30,583 --> 00:14:33,603
♪I shall forge a new age♪

270
00:14:33,940 --> 00:14:37,010
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

271
00:14:37,260 --> 00:14:40,350
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

272
00:14:40,570 --> 00:14:42,800
♪At cultivation's peak♪

273
00:14:42,940 --> 00:14:46,780
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

274
00:14:47,190 --> 00:14:49,810
♪The sun and moon turn♪

275
00:14:49,830 --> 00:14:53,500
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

276
00:14:53,960 --> 00:15:00,740
♪I am the undying flame♪

277
00:15:01,420 --> 00:15:06,140
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

278
00:15:06,490 --> 00:15:09,670
♪At last I see, immortality♪

279
00:15:09,830 --> 00:15:14,470
♪Lives in your smiles♪
